# The approval mode menu beside the composer lists the three modes and, as
# T3 Code's menu, closes once a mode is chosen, which the composer shows.
expect "何に取り組みますか？" 30000
press 承認方法を変更
expect "承認を求める"
expect "代わりに承認"
expect "フルアクセス"
screenshot modes
press フルアクセス
expect_absent "承認の確認なしで操作を実行します"
expect "フルアクセス"
screenshot applied
# Escape closes it without choosing.
press 承認方法を変更
expect "承認の確認なしで操作を実行します"
key escape
expect_absent "承認の確認なしで操作を実行します"
expect "フルアクセス"
